    "body": "There were several issues with it.\r\n- It didn't always initialise its attributes, only when starting from a `ModuleNode`.\r\n- Storing away the attributes inefficiently created a new tuple.\r\n- Calls to `.visit_scope()` needlessly went through the vtable.",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-12T19:53:46Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/7806#discussion_r3566162419"
                },
